[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 24.92,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.92,
    "end": 29.88,
    "text": "Take a slow breath in and let it out gently."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.88,
    "end": 52.14,
    "text": "Allow your body to settle."
  },
  {
    "start": 52.14,
    "end": 60.32,
    "text": "Feel the surface beneath you."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.32,
    "end": 70.6,
    "text": "Feel the subtle rhythm of your breathing."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.6,
    "end": 88.74,
    "text": "There is a steadiness available here, a quiet readiness."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.74,
    "end": 100.56,
    "text": "Stay with your breath for a little while."
  },
  {
    "start": 100.56,
    "end": 109.84,
    "text": "With each breath, your body softens."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.84,
    "end": 115.92,
    "text": "Your mind continues to open."
  },
  {
    "start": 115.92,
    "end": 126.88,
    "text": "Your awareness deepens."
  },
  {
    "start": 126.88,
    "end": 154.34,
    "text": "Now begin to imagine the space around your body expanding, as if the room grows wider,"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.34,
    "end": 166.64,
    "text": "The air becoming spacious."
  },
  {
    "start": 166.64,
    "end": 176.58,
    "text": "Subtle."
  },
  {
    "start": 176.58,
    "end": 184.98,
    "text": "Alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.98,
    "end": 197.12,
    "text": "You are sitting within a vast field of energy."
  },
  {
    "start": 197.12,
    "end": 206.5,
    "text": "Responsive"
  },
  {
    "start": 206.5,
    "end": 217.04,
    "text": "Intelligent"
  },
  {
    "start": 217.04,
    "end": 228.78,
    "text": "Every possibility already exists here."
  },
  {
    "start": 228.78,
    "end": 240.76,
    "text": "Every version of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.76,
    "end": 253.24,
    "text": "Somewhere in this field, there is a version of you,"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.24,
    "end": 270.02,
    "text": "Who already lives with clarity, confidence, purpose, ease."
  },
  {
    "start": 270.02,
    "end": 276.86,
    "text": "It is a potential that already exists."
  },
  {
    "start": 276.86,
    "end": 292.88,
    "text": "Take a breath and allow that version of you to begin forming in front of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 292.88,
    "end": 318.46,
    "text": "See them clearly, notice how they stand, how they breathe, how their eyes move."
  },
  {
    "start": 318.46,
    "end": 325.66,
    "text": "There is a sense of deep steadiness in them."
  },
  {
    "start": 325.66,
    "end": 332.28,
    "text": "There is certainty."
  },
  {
    "start": 332.28,
    "end": 338.92,
    "text": "There is depth."
  },
  {
    "start": 338.92,
    "end": 347.62,
    "text": "This is you, integrated."
  },
  {
    "start": 347.62,
    "end": 356.02,
    "text": "This is you, aligned."
  },
  {
    "start": 356.02,
    "end": 371.58,
    "text": "This is you, fully expressed."
  },
  {
    "start": 371.58,
    "end": 378.78,
    "text": "Allow yourself to step closer."
  },
  {
    "start": 378.78,
    "end": 389.4,
    "text": "Notice how it feels to stand next to this version of you:"
  },
  {
    "start": 389.4,
    "end": 396.66,
    "text": "Calm."
  },
  {
    "start": 396.66,
    "end": 404.5,
    "text": "Grounded."
  },
  {
    "start": 404.5,
    "end": 411.9,
    "text": "Capable."
  },
  {
    "start": 411.9,
    "end": 421.96,
    "text": "You can sense a deep self-trust."
  },
  {
    "start": 421.96,
    "end": 433.16,
    "text": "This version of you moves through life with quiet strength."
  },
  {
    "start": 433.16,
    "end": 443.54,
    "text": "You make decisions from clarity."
  },
  {
    "start": 443.54,
    "end": 453.1,
    "text": "You act from alignment."
  },
  {
    "start": 453.1,
    "end": 463.26,
    "text": "Take a slow breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 463.26,
    "end": 487.5,
    "text": "Again stepping into and embodying this version of yourself fully, gently, naturally, as if"
  },
  {
    "start": 487.5,
    "end": 499.9,
    "text": "Putting on a perfectly fitted garment."
  },
  {
    "start": 499.9,
    "end": 509.36,
    "text": "Feel the posture in your body shift."
  },
  {
    "start": 509.36,
    "end": 518.38,
    "text": "Feel the breath deepen."
  },
  {
    "start": 518.38,
    "end": 528.36,
    "text": "Feel the nervous system recalibrate."
  },
  {
    "start": 528.36,
    "end": 539.36,
    "text": "You are inhabiting this identity now."
  },
  {
    "start": 539.36,
    "end": 549.76,
    "text": "Notice the feeling of relaxation and peace in your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 549.76,
    "end": 577.52,
    "text": "Your shoulders, your face, your thoughts begin to organize differently."
  },
  {
    "start": 577.52,
    "end": 584.64,
    "text": "There is direction and clarity here."
  },
  {
    "start": 584.64,
    "end": 588.96,
    "text": "There is self-trust."
  },
  {
    "start": 588.96,
    "end": 596.28,
    "text": "Let that feeling settle deeply."
  },
  {
    "start": 596.28,
    "end": 604.76,
    "text": "Now allow this truth to root itself deeply into your core."
  },
  {
    "start": 604.76,
    "end": 611.44,
    "text": "I trust myself."
  },
  {
    "start": 611.44,
    "end": 618.52,
    "text": "I move with clarity."
  },
  {
    "start": 618.52,
    "end": 628.22,
    "text": "I act with confidence."
  },
  {
    "start": 628.22,
    "end": 637.54,
    "text": "Opportunities respond to who I am."
  },
  {
    "start": 637.54,
    "end": 647.46,
    "text": "I am aligned with the life I am creating."
  },
  {
    "start": 647.46,
    "end": 661.0,
    "text": "Let those words land as recognition."
  },
  {
    "start": 661.0,
    "end": 678.88,
    "text": "This is the frequency you continue to return to, again and again."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.88,
    "end": 690.46,
    "text": "Each time you listen, this version of yourself becomes even more natural."
  },
  {
    "start": 690.46,
    "end": 696.6,
    "text": "More embodied."
  },
  {
    "start": 696.6,
    "end": 702.78,
    "text": "More real."
  },
  {
    "start": 702.78,
    "end": 708.22,
    "text": "Take a deep breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 708.22,
    "end": 726.04,
    "text": "Feel the surface beneath you and feel the air on your skin."
  },
  {
    "start": 726.04,
    "end": 751.58,
    "text": "Bringing this version of yourself back fully into your body, breathing here, present here."
  },
  {
    "start": 751.58,
    "end": 766.1,
    "text": "When you are ready, open your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 766.1,
    "end": 767.1,
    "text": "Steady,"
  },
  {
    "start": 772.1,
    "end": 773.1,
    "text": "Clear,"
  },
  {
    "start": 778.7,
    "end": 779.7,
    "text": "Aligned,"
  },
  {
    "start": 784.1,
    "end": 786.1,
    "text": "And standing in your power."
  }
]
